nd. Great gaseous clouds of geologic mumbo jumbo get spewed into the dialogue, backed up with sombre graphs on computer screens and people drawing stuff on blackboards. But the gist is that Reykjavik is in danger.</p><p>Of course, the powers that be are sceptical about Annaâ€™s theories and donâ€™t want to cut off the islandâ€™s supply of sweet, sweet tourist money. Pretty soon, though, the signs are too numerous to ignore. And a big eruption either could last a day or two, or as Anna points out, for 30 years, like a volcano that erupted in the 9th century. (Good thing Icelandic history goes back that far.)</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/21/the-fires-review-volcanoes-and-passions-erupt-in-iceland-disaster-romance">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oj2Sk9UhLik_FRz5Eux3JE7ypAniyLVzYi4WQAgRtTQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;4S7Hqj-Xelfid5cbJSsolcOFNABlV8F5OSjSug16Glsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7bM-DqcVX6e9rJj38VCq_dfR0Qc7LLbmr-HGI1OsHBMƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YjZKk5V62pQnNZjCt7j5gkLCJ2kN3YJtX67gvE_IhvUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zw7P-mmE26b0oiZfRLihNjphxtREEj5Rche-_kRWhYoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rBKqewBwdFm0Lp_Q7GUoJZRo6R54Ibb005XM4ZoA36Mƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;toQ55DUCgA5M7vQYtk2dy5559LPhbKPxQ7AWCnwhiOwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhcons